<view class="flow-page"><text class="flow-title">建立训练计划</text><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="flow-error">{{error}}</view><view class="flow-card"><text class="flow-label">计划名称</text><input class="flow-input" value="{{name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="input" /><text class="flow-heading">选择已核对动作</text><view wx:for="{{choices}}" wx:key="id" class="flow-task" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggleCard"><text class="flow-check {{item.selected ? 'flow-checked' : ''}}">{{item.selected ? '✓' : ''}}</text><text class="flow-flex">{{item.name}}</text><text class="flow-small">{{item.confirmed ? '已核对' : '草稿'}}</text></view><text wx:if="{{!choices.length}}" class="flow-muted">请先建立并核对动作卡。</text></view><view class="flow-card"><text class="flow-heading">训练清单 · 按已确认顺序排列</text><view wx:for="{{selected}}" wx:key="id" class="flow-task"><text class="flow-flex">{{index + 1}}. {{item.name}}</text><text class="flow-link" data-index="{{index}}" data-delta="-1" bindtap="move">↑</text><text class="flow-link" data-index="{{index}}" data-delta="1" bindtap="move">↓</text></view></view><view class="flow-card"><text class="flow-heading">训练日程</text><view class="flow-tabs"><text wx:for="{{modes}}" wx:key="key" class="{{schedule === item.key ? 'flow-selected' : ''}}" data-mode="{{item.key}}" bindtap="schedule">{{item.label}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{schedule === 'weekdays'}}" class="flow-week"><text wx:for="{{weekdays}}" wx:key="index" class="flow-day {{item.selected ? 'flow-selected' : ''}}" data-index="{{item.index}}" bindtap="weekday">{{item.label}}</text></view><text wx:if="{{schedule === 'alternate'}}" class="flow-muted">按实际完整完成日顺延，未完成不会自动跳过。</text><block wx:if="{{schedule === 'period'}}"><text class="flow-label">周期天数</text><input class="flow-input" type="number" value="{{cycleDays}}" data-field="cycleDays" bindinput="input" /><text class="flow-label">周期内次数</text><input class="flow-input" type="number" value="{{cycleTimes}}" data-field="cycleTimes" bindinput="input" /></block><text class="flow-label">开始日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{start}}" data-field="start" bindchange="input"><view class="flow-input">{{start}}</view></picker><button class="flow-button flow-secondary" bindtap="toggleActive">{{active ? '进行中 · 点击暂停' : '已暂停 · 点击恢复'}}</button><text class="flow-small">频次与训练量以已确认要求为准。修改仅影响之后的新训练记录，已保存记录保留当时要求。</text><button class="flow-button" bindtap="save">确认并加入计划</button></view></view>
